,"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.psychology.social-maturity-narcissism"}},{"from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.biopsychosocial-cultural-spiritual-framework","id":"notes.psychology.biopsychosocial-cultural-spiritual-framework","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":39,"column":60,"offset":2425},"end":{"line":39,"column":113,"offset":2478},"indent":[]},"value":"notes.psychology.biological-social-pattern-fixing"}],"anchors":{"biological-and-social-factors-in-pattern-fixing":{"type":"header","text":"Biological and Social Factors in Pattern Fixing","value":"biological-and-social-factors-in-pattern-fixing","line":16,"column":0,"depth":1},"the-biological-foundation":{"type":"header","text":"The Biological Foundation","value":"the-biological-foundation","line":18,"column":0,"depth":2},"the-social-environment":{"type":"header","text":"The Social Environment","value":"the-social-environment","line":27,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"k7whujrtxo2tvftwjvbq1jh","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"biological-and-social-factors-in-pattern-fixing\">Biological and Social Factors in Pattern Fixing<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#biological-and-social-factors-in-pattern-fixing\"></a></h1>\n<h1 id=\"biological-and-social-factors-in-pattern-fixing-1\">Biological and Social Factors in Pattern Fixing<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#biological-and-social-factors-in-pattern-fixing-1\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"the-biological-foundation\">The Biological Foundation<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#the-biological-foundation\"></a></h2>\n<p>Kesehatan jiwa tidak terpisah dari kondisi biologis. Sistem saraf yang kacau membuat latihan psikologis menjadi jauh lebih berat.</p>\n<p><strong>Faktor Biologis yang Mempengaruhi Regulasi Ego:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Inflamasi Mental</strong>: Pola <em>sedentary</em> (kurang gerak), kurang tidur, dan konsumsi informasi berlebih (<em>doomscrolling</em>) dapat memicu inflamasi otak yang memperkuat gambaran depresif dan defensif.</li>\n<li><strong>Kondisi Fisik</strong>: Gizi buruk dan lingkungan yang tidak sehat membuat otak lebih mudah stres dan lebih reaktif terhadap trigger.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Saran Mitigasi Biologis</strong>: Tidur stabil, aktivitas fisik rutin, dan kontrol paparan gadget untuk menurunkan reaktivitas sistem saraf.</p>\n<h2 id=\"the-social-environment\">The Social Environment<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#the-social-environment\"></a></h2>\n<p>Lingkungan sosial bisa menjadi penguat pola lama atau katalis perubahan.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Toxic Affirmation</strong>: Teman yang hanya mengafirmasi luka (\"Iya, semua orang emang jahat\") justru mengunci individu dalam pola berulang.</li>\n<li><strong>Healthy Feedback</strong>: Teman sehat adalah mereka yang memberikan feedback jujur, memiliki visi yang sama, dan mendorong pertumbuhan tanpa menghakimi.</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Atomic Idea</strong>: Lingkungan yang cuma mengafirmasi luka bisa membuat pola berulang terasa seperti kebenaran.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>See also: <a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.social-maturity-narcissism\">Social Maturity and Narcissism Reduction</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">psychology (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">biology (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">social-support (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">health (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.biopsychosocial-cultural-spiritual-framework\">Biopsychosocial-Cultural-Spiritual Framework</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":false,"bubbleUpCreateNew":true,"fuzzThreshold":0.2}},"randomNote":{},"insertNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"none","enableMultiSelect":false},"insertNoteIndex":{"enableMarker":false},"copyNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"title"},"templateHierarchy":"template"},"workspace":{"dendronVersion":"0.83.0","vaults":[{"fsPath":"vault"}],"journal":{"dailyDomain":"daily","name":"journal","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd","addBehavior":"childOfDomain"},"scratch":{"name":"scratch","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd.HHmmss","addBehavior":"asOwnDomain"},"task":{"name":"","dateFormat":"","addBehavior":"childOfCurrent","statusSymbols":{"":" ","wip":"w","done":"x","assigned":"a","moved":"m","blocked":"b","delegated":"l","dropped":"d","pending":"y"},"prioritySymbols":{"H":"high","M":"medium","L":"low"},"todoIntegration":false,"createTaskSelectionType":"selection2link","taskCompleteStatus":["done","x"]},"graph":{"zoomSpeed":1,"createStub":false},"enableAutoCreateOnDefinition":false,"enableXVaultWikiLink":false,"enableRemoteVaultInit":true,"enableUserTags":true,"enableHashTags":true,"workspaceVaultSyncMode":"noCommit","enableAutoFoldFrontmatter":false,"enableEditorDecorations":true,"maxPreviewsCached":10,"maxNoteLength":204800,"seeds":{"dendron.templates":{}},"enableFullHierarchyNoteTitle":false},"preview":{"enableFMTitle":true,"enableNoteTitleForLink":true,"enableFrontmatterTags":true,"enableHashesForFMTags":false,"enablePrettyRefs":true,"enableKatex":true,"automaticallyShowPreview":false},"publishing":{"enableFMTitle":true,"enableNoteTitleForLink":t